<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="My First F-Droid Archive Demo" pubkey="" timestamp="1791785527" url="https://supermy.github.io/laya-test/fdroid/archive" version="20002"><description>These are the apps that have been archived from the main repo.</description></repo><application id="com.selfhost.layatest"><id>com.selfhost.layatest</id><added>2026-10-10</added><lastupdated>2026-10-12</lastupdated><name>业务决策台</name><summary>Laya 决策助手 — 端侧 LiteRT 分层决策(LiteRT layered decision assistant)</summary><desc>智能决策业务台:LiteRT 端侧推理(MTK NPU/GPU/CPU 引擎链),内置客服工单分流、UGC 审核、Agent 路由、金融风控、多语言分流五业务,支持动态注册新业务模型包;邮件/MQTT 网关接入决策指令;决策日志与日报/月报/年报/详单/下钻报表;界面中英双语。

Intelligent decision console: on-device LiteRT inference (NPU→GPU→CPU engine chain) with 5 builtin businesses, dynamic model packs, email/MQTT gateways, decision logs and reports. UI in Chinese and English.

